Z||000000||FOCONE||08-23-2001||09:16 PM||||This is just a reminder of FOCONE's 5th Annual Fall Show this September 23.  It is just about 4 weeks away.<P>General Schedule for the day is as follows: <BR>Show start times -- 9:00am at the Rutland Community Center<P>Lunch -- Pizza delivery from Tulla's Pizza in Rutland as in past years -- order and pay during show registration, day of show.<P>Show End Time -- 1:00pm<BR>Awards Ceremony ending time -- 1:45pm<P>Between 1:45pm - 2:00pm -- We start the cruise to Connecticut to visit the Parker's at Kick Hill Farm.<P>Everyone is free to leave Bob's at any time.  Of course you must first acquire a few trinkets from Bob before you leave.  Be sure to bring lots of cash.  You never can tell what you will need.<P>Show Registration is $11.00 for FOCONE members and $14.00 for Non-members.  If  you pre-register you save $4.00.  To qualify for the early registration you must have a copy of the registration form post marked by September 10, 2001.<P>For a registration form, please contact chris.schaefer@focone.org.<P>Thank you.<p>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||10
